Task #99: Calendar overflow on the month flex product: the 31st day is absorbed into the last active segment
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Status:      todo
  Priority:    high
  Class:       standard
  Assignee:    --
  Tags:        renewal-sync, day-06
