+# SLT-LIFE-02 — D06 early-renew evidence
+
+Date: 2026-08-08  
+Watch day: D06  
+Verdict: PASS
+
+## Identity and preflight
+
+- Canonical registry relationship: `SUB_CORE2=11991`, parent order `11990`, customer `357` (`slt-core2`, `slt-core2@example.test`, role `customer`), product `11927` (`SLT Daily Core`).
+- Subscription was `arraysubs-active`, Stripe test, saved Visa ending `4242`, USD `$10.00` every day, unsynced, with no `_pending_renewal_order_id`, `_skip_cycles_remaining`, or open renewal order.
+- Original due date `D_original=2026-08-08 13:23:13Z` (2026-08-08 19:23:13 UTC+6), completed payments `6`.
+- Spread offset `k=20,473s`. Old invoice action `15774` was pending at `2026-08-08 13:04:26Z`; old charge action `15775` was pending at `2026-08-08 19:04:26Z`. Both were unattempted. The portal mutation began at `2026-08-08 10:35:16Z`, before the invoice gate.
+- Cart count was zero and `_woocommerce_persistent_cart_1` was absent/empty before mutation.
+- Immutable Mailpit baseline immediately before mutation: `57lxgHohFqevl55xhVeR3P` at 2026-08-08 10:34:25Z.
+
+## Browser action
+
+- Isolated customer route/session: `/my-account/view-subscription/11991/`, `customer-SLT-LIFE-02`.
+- The portal showed **Renew Early** and stated that paying the renewal due 8 August 2026 19:23 UTC+6 would move the next payment to 9 August 2026 19:23 UTC+6: `SLT-LIFE-02-01-notice.png`.
+- The confirmation dialog stated `$10.00`, the original due date, and the one-day-later next date: `SLT-LIFE-02-02-dialog.png`.
+- **Renew Now** was clicked exactly once. `POST /wp-json/arraysubs/v1/my-subscriptions/11991/early-renew` returned HTTP `200`; the reload and cart requests also returned `200`. Browser errors were empty and the only console output was the normal JQMIGRATE informational line.
+- The success state showed next payment 9 August 2026 19:23 UTC+6 and related completed order `#13257`: `SLT-LIFE-02-03-success.png` and `SLT-LIFE-02-04-portal-after.png`.
+- Capture limitation: the browser network recorder proved the successful REST request but did not expose its JSON response body. The numeric early-renew order was therefore resolved from the exact relationship set difference and then fully cross-checked, rather than copied from the response body. There was exactly one matching new relationship: `OE=13257`.
+
+## Exact order and subscription proof
+
+- Order `13257`: `wc-completed`, created `2026-08-08 10:35:16Z`, customer `357`, gateway `stripe`, currency `USD`, total `$10.00`, tax `$0.00`.
+- One line item only: product `11927`, quantity `1`, line subtotal/total `$10.00`. Coupon rows `0`, fee rows `0`, tax rows `0`; therefore no proration, discount, or tax was applied.
+- Exact order metadata:
+  - `_arraysubs_early_renewal=yes`
+  - `_is_renewal_order=yes`
+  - `_renewal_cycle_number=7`
+  - `_renewal_scheduled_date=2026-08-08 13:23:13`
+  - `_subscription_id=11991`
+  - `_subscription_renewal=11991`
+  - `_subscription_payment_processed=yes`
+- Subscription note `13258`: `Renewal invoice #13257 generated for payment due on 8 August, 2026 7:23 PM (UTC+6).` Gateway/payment notes `13259`, `13261`, `13262`, email note `13263`, and payment-success note `13264` all link order `13257`.
+- Post-state subscription: active, completed payments `7`, last payment `2026-08-08 10:35:19Z`, next payment `2026-08-09 13:23:13Z`, no pending-order/skip/sync row. The next date is exactly `D_original + 86,400s`, not click time plus one day.
+
+## Queue replacement
+
+- Before: screenshot `SLT-LIFE-02-04-pending-before.png` shows exactly pending actions `15774`/`15775` at `2026-08-08 13:04:26Z` and `19:04:26Z`.
+- After: old actions `15774`/`15775` are `canceled`, unattempted. Exactly one replacement pair exists: invoice `16010` pending at `2026-08-09 13:04:26Z`, charge `16011` pending at `2026-08-09 19:04:26Z`; same `k=20,473s`. Screenshot: `SLT-LIFE-02-05-pending-after.png`.
+
+## Mailpit delta
+
+The complete delta newer than immutable baseline `57lxgHohFqevl55xhVeR3P` contained exactly two messages:
+
+1. `5Og5lU3hYA9w6agG5zFt5x` — `[mirror-help.arrayhash.com] Payment received for subscription #11991` — to `slt-core2@example.test`; body names subscription `11991`, `$10.00`, Stripe, and next payment 9 August 2026 19:23 UTC+6.
+2. `1v4wEPpLXvCUvaKkQCezmY` — `[mirror-help.arrayhash.com]: You've got a new order: #13257` — to `admin@mirror-help.arrayhash.com`; body names order `13257`, product `SLT Daily Core`, quantity `1`, and `$10.00` total.
+
+No customer WooCommerce processing/completed mail, Stripe renewal invoice, new-subscription mail, or one-day reminder was present in the complete delta.
+
+## Portal follow-up and Paddle negative
+
+- After payment, Stripe subscription `11991` offered **Renew Early** again because the replacement cycle is already within the baseline eligibility window and there is no invoice/open renewal order. This is visible in `SLT-LIFE-02-03-success.png` and `SLT-LIFE-02-04-portal-after.png`.
