  "Text": "mirror-help.arrayhash.com ( https://mirror-help.arrayhash.com )\n\n********************************\nYour subscription is now active!\n********************************\n\nHi SLT,\n\nGreat news! Your subscription is now active. Here are the details:\n\n-------------------\nSubscription #13277\n-------------------\n\nProduct SLT Flex Month Segments Price $ 30.00 / Every month Start Date 8 August, 2026 6:14 PM (UTC+6) Next Payment 1 October, 2026 12:00 AM (UTC+6)\n\nView your subscription ( https://mirror-help.arrayhash.com/my-account/subscriptions/ )\n\nThank you for subscribing! If you have any questions, please contact us.\n\nmirror-help.arrayhash.com\nUnited Kingdom (UK)",
  "HTML": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en-US\">\r\n\t<head>\r\n\t\t<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\r\n\t\t<meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" name=\"viewport\">\r\n\t\t<title>mirror-help.arrayhash.com</title>\r\n\t<style type=\"text/css\">@media screen and (max-width: 600px){#template_header_image,#header_wrapper{padding: 16px 10px 0 !important;}#header_wrapper h1{font-size: 24px !important;}#body_content_inner_cell{padding: 10px !important;}#body_content_inner{font-size: 12px !important;}}</style></head>\r\n\t<body leftmargin=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" topmargin=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\" offset=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #fff; padding: 0; text-align: center;\" bgcolor=\"#fff\">\r\n\t\t<table width=\"100%\" id=\"outer_wrapper\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color: #fff;\" bgcolor=\"#fff\">\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td><!-- Deliberately empty to support consistent sizing and layout across multiple email clients. --></td>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td width=\"600\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"wrapper\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 0; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none;\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" height=\"100%\" width=\"100%\" id=\"inner_wrapper\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"background-color: #fff; border-radius: 8px;\" bgcolor=\"#fff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td id=\"template_header_image\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"email-logo-text\" style='color: #111; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left;' align=\"left\"><a href=\"https://mirror-help.arrayhash.com\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-weight: normal; color: inherit; text-decoration: none;\">mirror-help.arrayhash.com</a></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" id=\"template_container\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"box-shadow: none; background-color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 3px;\" bgcolor=\"#fff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Header -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" id=\"template_header\" role=\"presentation\" style='background-color: #fff; color: #111; border-bottom: 0; font-weight: bold; line-height: 100%; vertical-align: middle; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; border-radius: 3px 3px 0 0;' bgcolor=\"#fff\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td id=\"header_wrapper\" style=\"padding: 20px 32px 0; display: block;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 style='font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\",Helvetica,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 120%; margin: 0; color: #111; background-color: inherit; text-align: left;' bgcolor=\"inherit\">Your subscription is now active!</h1>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- End Header -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Body -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" id=\"template_body\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\